    "title": "RR vs RCB head-to-head record, IPL 2026: Rajasthan Royals v Royal Challengers Bengaluru overall stats; most runs, wickets",
    "text": "RR will look to extend its winning run this season as it faces RCB in Guwahati. | Photo Credit: REUTERS RR will look to extend its winning run this season as it faces RCB in Guwahati. | Photo Credit: REUTERS An unbeaten Rajasthan Royals will take on Royal Challengers Bengaluru in a clash to extend unbeaten run at the Barsapara Cricket Stadium in Guwahati on Friday.Both teams are yet to lose a game this season with RR winning all three of the games it has played and RCB winning both its matches so far.Bengaluru drubbed Rajasthan in both its encounters in the 2025 season by 11 runs and nine wickets.Here are the head-to-head records between the two teams in IPL: RR vs RCB head-to-head record Matches played: 34 RR won: 14 RCB won: 17 No results: 3 MOST RUNS IN RR vs RCB IPL MATCHES Batter Innings Runs Average Strike Rate HS Virat Kohli 32 896 34.46 123.92 113* AB De Villiers 16 488 44.36 161.58 66 Sanju Samson 20 445 23.42 141.26 92* Jos Buttler 11 420 52.5 150 106* Devdutt Padikkal 11 420 46.66 143.83 101*MOST WICKETS IN RR VS RCB MATCHES Bowler Innings Wickets Economy Average BBI Yuzvendra Chahal 19 24 6.86 19.58 3/24 Harshal Patel 9 17 7.69 15.47 3/32 Shreyas Gopal 7 14 6.5 11.14 4/16 Mohammed Siraj 11 12 8.3 27 3/27 Josh Hazlewood 4 9 6.73 11.22 4/33Published on Apr 10, 2026",
